", "id": "2828956927483990", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_2828956930817323_589672073038431333_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1psLSTlW-WkQ7kNvwFDZJqE&_nc_oc=AdqCquGBCKcnja2B5KWdfOtyfY3bH3_CPC4nCDjU5_F_DAIW3qqhLjdXTwtGMF7ioXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQROdcv-75WwxpfR8dNd4jRVMdHJk_Yl0YF7LdMh904yZQ&oe=6AF9C2B0"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-2-playing.png", "id": "1754014090065974", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1754014093399307_279176435794436414_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jgBaXBUowz4Q7kNvwE6P9Rr&_nc_oc=AdreDCHfDCNWFg_i_uvojS3_C7Bno3assqBxTrvqxy8qnEowBTcI6KrsLCCiF_J7SkM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_ARyPgD6Amcvz2ib7k3RpUpwijjL5lDGIixgZJ3P8gg&oe=6AF9B4BC"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-3-series.png", "id": "1404211985204123", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1404211988537456_3185832738215004774_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DT31U_VAPrgQ7kNvwHY85ou&_nc_oc=AdooWekl-CIyLX6c1yn2EGWH5jSUKtv2NGeu_oJsI36L4mo_beIGxRYcGhmcJdKBCB4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSBVUBP5-0vOfAOZiQM6L-nn-UC3WZjlPhr2vXrW7JxlQ&oe=6AF9C55F"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-4-environment-station.png", "id": "982933147479863", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_982933150813196_1098495751667877981_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GGDRXypA2WMQ7kNvwH6Dp0F&_nc_oc=Ado3Y5dilZkBTDIu80_pEJIneoSOoBGcOx112NsOpVL2sC8tVBw-NNDJYexlKRug_rQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS825erWpY1uJBT2pPCgei7Sjm5rlNYkTZbCWkh9LMnjQ&oe=6AF9C10A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-environment-cabin.png", "id": "1524763559413134", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300725_1524763562746467_764910693733824437_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=27MCAg0jKpoQ7kNvwGwtURh&_nc_oc=AdoigXKnw57B3YsnKgZ6HGLqqoQPuzBne3IoOAldzrQk2JoxfexyVnUXiXpfnhlxmsk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJLiRrjWrvp2JEM2_LMyu8gICj3apvE0X-FnD1p6KEtA&oe=6AF9E881"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "JellyTheatre", "keywords": ["jellyfin", "media", "movie"], "long_description": "JellyTheatre turns your Meta Quest into a private cinema for your Jellyfin\nmedia server. Sign in with a Quick Connect code (no typing), pick a film and\nwatch it on a giant screen.\n\nPLACES TO WATCH\n- A movie theatre with dimming lights and a screen that lights up the room\n- A home cinema, a lakeside cabin with a crackling fire, the Cupola of a space\n  station floating above the planet, a dark void\n- Your own room in passthrough, with a screen you can place anywhere\n\nYOUR LIBRARY, IN SYNC\n- Continue watching, next up, new movies and shows, favourites, search\n- Seasons and episodes with thumbnails and watched marks\n- Your progress and watched status go back to Jellyfin, so you can pick up on\n  any other device\n\nGENTLE ON YOUR SERVER\n- Plays your files directly whenever the headset can, so your server doesn't\n  have to convert them\n- Shows whether a film plays directly or is being converted\n\nMADE FOR WATCHING\n- Subtitles (text and Blu-ray PGS) with size, style, position and timing\n- Skip intro and credits, chapters, seek bar previews, up-next episodes\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n- A Jellyfin server reachable over HTTPS\n- A Jellyfin account on that server\n\nJellyTheatre is an independent project, not affiliated with the Jellyfin\nproject. It does not provide any content: it plays the media on your own\nserver.\n\nScreenshots show Blender Foundation open movies (Tears of Steel, Sintel,\nCaminandes and others), CC BY, \u00a9 Blender Foundation, studio.blender.org.", "short_description": "Watch your own Jellyfin library on a giant screen: a movie theatre, a home cinema, a lakeside cabin